113
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:42,305
If you happen to
be using a driver,

114
00:04:42,305 --> 00:04:44,300
that's common or if you're

115
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:46,970
extending the functionality
of a driver that already

116
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:48,920
is defined in this common like

117
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:51,750
one example is this
SCSI disk driver,

118
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:54,020
so this is one of the
main drivers that

119
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:56,620
