120
00:04:56,620 --> 00:04:59,200
Because it's a common device,

121
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:01,580
there's a dedicated major
number and in some cases,

122
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:03,395
there's dedicated minor numbers

123
00:05:03,395 --> 00:05:08,405
for SCSI or for those
particular drivers.

124
00:05:08,405 --> 00:05:10,550
For the sda case, for instance,

125
00:05:10,550 --> 00:05:12,400
there's a major
